abstract: >-
  An evidence-driven Quality Engineering framework for tracing, evaluating and
  diagnosing LLM, RAG and agentic AI systems from prompt to production. The
  work introduces a Trace-Evaluate-Diagnose-Experiment-Regress model connecting
  runtime telemetry, retrieval evidence, tool trajectories, quality evaluations,
  datasets, experiments, privacy controls, CI/CD quality gates and production
  feedback into durable regression intelligence.
